# RentLoop Core

Peer-to-peer rental marketplace (college BEE). Tagline: **Don't Buy It. Rent It.**

Users: Renter (Discover → Book → Return → Review) and Owner (List → Price → Manage → Earn).

## Scope

Premium UI + realistic implementation + viva-explainable code. Prefer simple over SaaS complexity.

## Honesty

Never claim unimplemented features (AI, delivery, QR, insurance, real auth/payments/APIs/notifications). Demo auth, listings, and rentals use localStorage only.

## Process

Work phase by phase. Phases 1–5 complete. Do not start the next phase unless asked.

After meaningful work: `npm run build` must pass. Stop when the requested phase is done.

## Decision rule

Choose simpler, cleaner, easier to explain, better for the RentLoop UX.
